usage: run_spatial_vae_engine.py [-h] --mode {independent,sync} --spool-root
                                 SPOOL_ROOT [--dataset-root DATASET_ROOT]
                                 --weights WEIGHTS [--cosmos-root COSMOS_ROOT]
                                 [--task TASK] [--episode EPISODE]
                                 [--engine-config ENGINE_CONFIG] [--gpus GPUS]
                                 [--max-batch-size MAX_BATCH_SIZE]
                                 [--max-wait-ms MAX_WAIT_MS]
                                 [--idle-timeout-s IDLE_TIMEOUT_S]
                                 [--max-events MAX_EVENTS]
                                 [--max-spool-bytes MAX_SPOOL_BYTES]
                                 [--max-result-bytes MAX_RESULT_BYTES]
                                 [--max-records MAX_RECORDS]
                                 [--source-policy SOURCE_POLICY]
                                 [--stop-file STOP_FILE]
                                 [--expected-episodes EXPECTED_EPISODES]
                                 [--producer-done PRODUCER_DONE]
                                 [--expected-recipe-id EXPECTED_RECIPE_ID]
                                 [--expected-weights-sha256 EXPECTED_WEIGHTS_SHA256]
                                 [--resume] [--serve] [--isolated-test]
                                 (--plan | --initialize | --execute)

Shared true B1..32/T1 multi-GPU engine, independent or producer-fed. Planning
computes source/weight/recipe identity without constructing Wan. Independent
mode watches published episodes; sync mode serves final-pixel events.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --mode {independent,sync}
  --spool-root SPOOL_ROOT
  --dataset-root DATASET_ROOT
  --weights WEIGHTS
  --cosmos-root COSMOS_ROOT
  --task TASK
  --episode EPISODE
  --engine-config ENGINE_CONFIG
  --gpus GPUS           physical indices, default4,5,6,7
  --max-batch-size MAX_BATCH_SIZE
  --max-wait-ms MAX_WAIT_MS
  --idle-timeout-s IDLE_TIMEOUT_S
  --max-events MAX_EVENTS
  --max-spool-bytes MAX_SPOOL_BYTES
  --max-result-bytes MAX_RESULT_BYTES
  --max-records MAX_RECORDS
  --source-policy SOURCE_POLICY
  --stop-file STOP_FILE
  --expected-episodes EXPECTED_EPISODES
  --producer-done PRODUCER_DONE
  --expected-recipe-id EXPECTED_RECIPE_ID
  --expected-weights-sha256 EXPECTED_WEIGHTS_SHA256
  --resume
  --serve               sync lifecycle (no idle exit)
  --isolated-test       permit explicit one-shot crash injection in a separate
                        sample
  --plan, --dry-run
  --initialize
  --execute
